UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Export ChatGPT conversations to another AI. Switching from ChatGPT to Gemini, Claude, or DeepSeek? You do not have to start from scratch. Here is the fastest way to move your history over: 1. Open any ChatGPT conversation 2. Ask it to write a complete biography about you based on all your chats 3. Tell it to ask clarifying questions about anything it missed 4. Copy the output and paste it into your new AI You lose some context, but you keep the important stuff. Your preferences, your projects, your patterns. The full export option is in Settings > Data Controls, but it takes longer and dumps everything. This biography method gives you a clean summary in minutes. Have you switched from ChatGPT to another AI? What made you switch? Which AI do you prefer now? #ai #chatgpt #aitools #technology #productivityhacks' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7607071215752088845';
