UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'I found a travel brand driving 15M+ views / month across 11 TikTok accounts. One account has 683 followers, with multiple videos over 170k views. Most marketers have no idea how this strategy works. Their effectiveness is decaying rapidly. They are quickly becoming dinosaurs. Don''t be like them. This travel brand has a full-on content ecosystem: the brand account, multiple employee accounts, affiliated accounts, and more. All publishing daily. All feeding the algorithm. All generating halo. All competing for a chance to become their best performing paid ads for zero media cost. The old model: → Budget determined creative volume → Ads launched straight into paid testing → Creatives competed for spend → Losers generated zero value → Insights came from paid data only The new model: → Every video gets posted organically first → The algorithm tests everything for free → Every post generates signal and net value → Winners earn their way into paid → Your best-performing ads are pre-validated Do you understand that the bottleneck does not exist anymore? It''s no longer "what should we say this month?" It''s "how do we say everything, everywhere, all the f*****g time?" What I found when I dug into this brand: → 11 separate TikTok accounts, all active → 1000+ videos published per month across the network → Hundreds of videos with 100K+ views → Micro-accounts outperforming accounts 100x their size → Minimal correlation between followers and views This is what social marketing looks like in 2026. #creativestrategy #adstrategy #metaads #tiktokads #marketing ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7591114604726521119';
