UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'LH voicings are not complicated. And they''re also not that important in the big picture. Just learn the various shells voicings and rootless voicings. I''ve had students obssess over LH voicings, and it''s like a restaurant owner obssessing over having the best chairs instead of focusing on the food. Like bruh, just get something that''s gonna hold people up and look decent, and move on to what''s important. Which is the RH soloing. So learn just enough LH voicings so that you can continue focusing on soloing. The different shell voicings and rootless voicings. And move on. #jazz #jazzimprov #jazzpiano #jazzpianist #jazzimprovisation #jazzpianolessons #jazzpianolesson #musictheory #musictheorylessons #pianolesson #pianolessons' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7550565279709941022';